WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:07.506
Co-Pilots is a cooperative game for exactly two players. You're flying a plane, and you have to land it.

2
00:00:08.206 --> 00:00:15.709
One of you is the pilot and the other is the co-pilot. Each round you both roll four dice that only you can see.

3
00:00:15.859 --> 00:00:23.053
You take turns placing one die at a time into the cockpit. Axis, engines, radio, and landing gear.

4
00:00:23.753 --> 00:00:36.252
The axis keeps the plane level. If your two dice are too far apart, you tilt. The engines add your dice together to decide how fast you move. And the radio clears other planes out of your way.

5
00:00:36.402 --> 00:00:39.512
Landing gear needs five dice of three or higher.

6
00:00:40.212 --> 00:00:44.825
You can talk all you want, but you can never say what your dice actually show.

7
00:00:44.975 --> 00:00:50.579
Land on the runway within eight rounds, without crashing or colliding, and you win together.
